## Docs — the decision log ships, working notes stay local.
##
## DECISIONS.md is the argument this project exists to make, so excluding it
## published the conclusion and withheld the reasoning. Status audits are
## point-in-time working notes with no value to a reader, and CLAUDE.md carries
## machine-specific detail; both stay local. Delete the CLAUDE.md line to
## publish it.
STATUS_*.md
CLAUDE.md

## Load testing — the harness ships, its measurements do not.
##
## A summary is one machine's numbers on one day. It is worth keeping locally to
## compare against the next run, and worth nothing to a reader of the repo, who
## cannot tell it apart from a claim about how the system performs generally.
## The one session the README quotes is copied to load/evidence/ instead (033).
load/results/
